      "title": "FVS SGR: Investment - Lucaprint",
      "what_changed": "Lucaprint strengthens its leadership in packaging and aims to grow with the support of FVS SGR Spa, which invests with the Fondo Sviluppo PMI 2. Sixth transaction for the Fondo Sviluppo PMI 2 managed by the SGR controlled by Veneto Sviluppo S.p.A., which will join Lucaprint's long-standing shareholders. Lucaprint will be able to accelerate its plan \"FVS SGR invests in Lucaprint, Vicenza-based group active in the sustainable packaging sector \"",
